Optional host FMOD module

GSW does not include or license FMOD. The optional libgrc_fmod module only drives
an opt-in title's own licensed FMOD inside that host game's process. Any other
deployment needs its own licence determination. FMOD SDK headers, libraries,
examples and game audio banks are not distributed with GSW.

Before a release ships this module, re-diff the FMOD EULA and FAQ against the
maintainer's archived copies.
